Description: LDAP daemon backed by system accounts
 A read-only LDAP server (RFC 4510) that exposes the local POSIX user and group
 database over the LDAP protocol. Bind requests are authenticated via PAM.
 Anonymous binds are accepted. TLS (LDAPS) is supported.

